{"4397880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ReEvolution Project", "steam_appid": 4397880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4809450], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I ended up alone in a city full of those strange monsters. Who are they? What do they want?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> They killed my family, but I managed to escape. I have to survive on my own now.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One day, a man has found and shot me, but I'm not dead... How is this possible?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I barricaded myself in an old, decaying house. It looks abandoned, but somehow feels alive. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>What is it hiding?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ReEvolution Project</strong> is a post-apocalyptic story-driven horror game set in a long-abandoned city overrun by strange humanoid creatures. You have taken refuge in a forgotten house, your only safe place for now. Search for supplies, explore the decaying rooms, and uncover the secrets lurking beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on exploration and atmosphere, offering a slow-paced, story-driven experience set in a desolate, post-apocalyptic world. Explore abandoned spaces, search for supplies, and uncover the mysteries hidden within.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/6d34032ba75edc0960c8fc2362d634bf.poster.avif?t=1781615932\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/6d34032ba75edc0960c8fc2362d634bf.webm?t=1781615932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/6d34032ba75edc0960c8fc2362d634bf.mp4?t=1781615932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most small objects can be picked up, moved around, and thrown, physically interacting with the environment. Some items may be examined to reveal fragments of a forgotten story, while others can be collected and used later.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/3bb6c8b26f2669aa6f1b3b3b4409a650.poster.avif?t=1781615932\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/3bb6c8b26f2669aa6f1b3b3b4409a650.webm?t=1781615932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/3bb6c8b26f2669aa6f1b3b3b4409a650.mp4?t=1781615932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To progress, you'll need to solve puzzles that challenge the way you see the world. Some are required to move forward, while others are optional, rewarding curious players with deeper insight into the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/f643431e74723e1301e3e2087c83ebc8.poster.avif?t=1781615932\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/f643431e74723e1301e3e2087c83ebc8.webm?t=1781615932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/f643431e74723e1301e3e2087c83ebc8.mp4?t=1781615932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I ended up alone in a city full of those strange monsters. Who are they? What do they want?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> They killed my family, but I managed to escape. I have to survive on my own now.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One day, a man has found and shot me, but I'm not dead... How is this possible?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I barricaded myself in an old, decaying house. It looks abandoned, but somehow feels alive. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>What is it hiding?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ReEvolution Project</strong> is a post-apocalyptic story-driven horror game set in a long-abandoned city overrun by strange humanoid creatures. You have taken refuge in a forgotten house, your only safe place for now. Search for supplies, explore the decaying rooms, and uncover the secrets lurking beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on exploration and atmosphere, offering a slow-paced, story-driven experience set in a desolate, post-apocalyptic world. Explore abandoned spaces, search for supplies, and uncover the mysteries hidden within.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/6d34032ba75edc0960c8fc2362d634bf.poster.avif?t=1781615932\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/6d34032ba75edc0960c8fc2362d634bf.webm?t=1781615932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397880/extras/6d34032ba75edc0960c8fc2362d634bf.mp4?t=1781615932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><